@page "/changelog"

<PageTitle>Changelog - RaceTrade</PageTitle>

<div class="page-head">
    <h1><Icon Name="changelog" Size="18" />Changelog</h1>
</div>

<div class="doc-page changelog-page">
    <section class="doc-hero">
        <div>
            <span class="doc-kicker">Current branch</span>
            <h2>v2.1.2</h2>
            <p>
                This page tracks user-facing RaceTrade changes for the new web build.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="timeline">
        <article class="timeline-item current">
            <div class="timeline-version">v2.1.2</div>
            <div class="timeline-date">August 2026</div>
            <ul>
                <li>Added Incomplete Auto-FXP support to detect incomplete announces, search other enabled/source sites and queue repair FXP jobs automatically.</li>
                <li>Added duplicate/copy actions for RaceTrade sites and CBFTP sites with name prompts and matching-name warnings.</li>
                <li>Improved Logs, History and Skips with pagination and viewport-friendly layouts.</li>
                <li>Improved Search and FXP search layout, including cleaner light-mode spacing and direct FXP result handling.</li>
                <li>Cleaned up Race and CBFTP log presentation with clearer structured fields for site, section, release and target details.</li>
            </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-version">v2.1.1</div>
            <div class="timeline-date">August 2026</div>
            <ul>
                <li>Added a Windows tray icon with right-click actions for opening RaceTrade, starting/stopping the trader, toggling race notifications, sending a test notification and quitting RaceTrade.</li>
                <li>Added saved notification settings for the tray icon and race notifications, including a test race notification button.</li>
                <li>Fixed tray icon startup, right-click handling and packaged icon loading so the notification-area icon works from the single-file release executable.</li>
                <li>Disabled and greyed out tray notification controls on Linux and other non-Windows builds.</li>
                <li>Added CBFTP server testing from the CBFTP servers page with connection timing, auth check and response preview on failure.</li>
                <li>Added site Test and Login checks on the Sites page for validating CBFTP site config and root listing access.</li>
                <li>Fixed long notification status text in Settings so it wraps inside the panel instead of overflowing.</li>
            </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-version">v2.1.0</div>
            <div class="timeline-date">August 2026</div>
            <ul>
                <li>Added a global CBFTP release Search page using <code>SITE SEARCH</code>, with selected-site searching and direct FXP from search results.</li>
                <li>Added an FXP search modal with destination site, known section and manual destination path selection.</li>
                <li>Restored FXP Client file viewing for NFO, DIZ, SFV, text and image files without writing temporary files.</li>
                <li>Added log pagination with configurable rows per page so large live logs stay usable.</li>
                <li>Expanded CBFTP job-status logging with section, target sites, subpaths, size, time and speed details when the CBFTP API provides them.</li>
                <li>Added CBFTP job details to completed/failed Race log rows, including subpaths, file count, size, speed and elapsed time.</li>
                <li>Prepared speed handling for CBFTP's real transfer-average speed field while keeping size/time throughput clearly marked as an estimate.</li>
                <li>Improved update checks so the header can refresh the available-version notice while RaceTrade is running.</li>
                <li>Cleaned up the Site Editor Announce tab with generic examples, working default regex guidance and Ignore words placed with the announce fields.</li>
                <li>Reworked the Site Editor Sections layout so default mapping/rule/filter panels use the viewport more cleanly and expanded filter panels appear under their toggles.</li>
                <li>Improved rule editing with clearer mapping/section rule rows and move controls.</li>
            </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-version">v2.0.9</div>
            <div class="timeline-date">August 2026</div>
            <ul>
                <li>Restored race and CBFTP log output for live announces by making announce-bot matching less brittle while keeping the old matching behaviour.</li>
                <li>Added source channel and release columns to the Logs page so Race and CBFTP entries are easier to trace.</li>
                <li>Rendered IRC colour markup in Dashboard activity and Logs so sections, releases and rule matches are readable again.</li>
                <li>Restored completed and failed race status logging.</li>
                <li>Improved repeat/duplicate announce diagnostics with the source channel and original announce line.</li>
                <li>Fixed FiSH/Blowfish handling by stripping cbc:/ecb: key prefixes, respecting use_blowfish and logging key/decrypt errors clearly.</li>
                <li>Moved Ignore words to the Announce tab and added clearer announce regex examples.</li>
                <li>Added Settings reset tools for release history, live logs, skips, duplicate releases and pretime cache.</li>
                <li>Restored use_tls and use_blowfish config compatibility for migrated site files.</li>
                <li>Reworked Logs into clean columns for site, channel, status, section, release, target sites and message.</li>
                <li>Cleaned up Race and CBFTP log rows so release, section and site data are not duplicated in the message text.</li>
                <li>Added log colours for statuses, sections, releases, sites and failure reasons.</li>
            </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-version">v2.0.8</div>
            <div class="timeline-date">August 2026</div>
            <ul>
                <li>Improved the mobile WebUI layout with a full-width Trader Status card and hamburger sidebar menu.</li>
                <li>Made the mobile menu close automatically after selecting a page.</li>
                <li>Fixed responsive Dashboard shortcut buttons so they wrap cleanly and switch to compact icon buttons on mobile.</li>
                <li>Fixed the Sites table on mobile so actions stay visible with compact icon buttons.</li>
                <li>Fixed page scrolling on Dashboard, Chat, FXP Client, Pre, Logs, Skips and History so content is not clipped on smaller viewports.</li>
                <li>Moved Pre and FXP status/error messages into their log panels to prevent page layout shifts.</li>
                <li>Improved Chat connect/disconnect feedback for missing or invalid IRC configuration and cleared the chat view after disconnect.</li>
                <li>Improved Pre page alignment and added mouse drag reordering for section and mapping rules.</li>
            </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-version">v2.0.7</div>
            <div class="timeline-date">August 2026</div>
            <ul>
                <li>Added a saved Light/Dark mode switch in the header next to Sign out and Quit.</li>
                <li>Added a light-mode RaceTrade logo and improved light-mode Help page contrast.</li>
                <li>Expanded Help and Changelog pages to use the full available width.</li>
                <li>Added a running spinner to the Trader Status card.</li>
                <li>Made the Sites status pill clickable so sites can be enabled or disabled from the overview.</li>
                <li>Aligned the Sites status/action columns so the overview uses the full table width cleanly.</li>
                <li>Improved light-mode contrast for Pre site labels, status badges, destination chips and disabled actions.</li>
                <li>Fixed the light-mode Quit confirmation panel so its text and buttons are readable.</li>
            </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-version">v2.0.6</div>
            <div class="timeline-date">August 2026</div>
            <ul>
                <li>Changed Chat connect to a manual site picker so it no longer auto-connects every site with IRC settings.</li>
                <li>Added an optional update check that shows a small header link when GitHub has a newer RaceTrade release.</li>
                <li>Added a Settings toggle for update checks, with no popup and no automatic install.</li>
                <li>Fixed the Settings current-version display and aligned Settings card action buttons to the bottom of their panels.</li>
                <li>Compact FXP Client layout, moved site status into the toolbar and stopped panes from browsing a site until that pane's site is selected.</li>
            </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-version">v2.0.5</div>
            <div class="timeline-date">August 2026</div>
            <ul>
                <li>Fixed the FXP Client transfer flow with live cbftp job progress, completion/failure status and pane refresh after queued transfers.</li>
                <li>Added a parent-directory row to the FXP browser panes so moving up is visible and works like a normal FTP client.</li>
                <li>Fixed request auto-fill startup so enabled request sites are polled when the racer starts and refreshed immediately after saving a site.</li>
                <li>Added request auto-fill status text in the Site Editor so it is clear whether the selected site is currently being polled.</li>
                <li>Added a Skips page showing why releases were rejected, grouped by duplicate, section, skiplist, blacklist, pretime, IMDB, TVMaze, rules and site config reasons.</li>
                <li>Expanded Test Release output with per-site skip reasons instead of only showing that all sites were filtered out.</li>
                <li>Fixed the RaceTrade logo in single-file releases by bundling the logo asset with the WebUI executable.</li>
                <li>Moved Pre under the Tools section in the sidebar.</li>
            </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-version">v2.0.4</div>
            <div class="timeline-date">August 2026</div>
            <ul>
                <li>Added a per-channel chat connected status after IRC confirms the channel member list.</li>
                <li>Fixed Chat user list refresh for channels that miss the first NAMES snapshot and removed the duplicate toolbar user count.</li>
                <li>Restored Global PreBot selection/startup from site configs and fixed PreBot pretime storage.</li>
                <li>Stopped Chat from logging missing FiSH key warnings when a channel or PM is intentionally using plaintext.</li>
                <li>Added a Settings save action for Debug logging and Allow insecure SSL so both survive app restarts.</li>
                <li>Added Linux ARM64 publish/release support for Raspberry Pi 5 and other ARM64 hosts.</li>
            </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-version">v2.0.3</div>
            <div class="timeline-date">August 2026</div>
            <ul>
                <li>Added persistent release history so races seen survives restarts, with a full History page and reset controls in Settings.</li>
                <li>Added a Dashboard Releases stat for unique release names seen by the race engine.</li>
                <li>Kept history capture isolated from the race path so a history write problem cannot interrupt racing.</li>
                <li>Improved Chat with channel tabs, private message tabs, rank-colored user lists, IRC color rendering and saved Blowfish key loading.</li>
                <li>Restored the IRC section dropdown, all-sites option and Clear action in Test release.</li>
                <li>Moved GitHub, linknet, Sign out and Quit into a header bar so the full sidebar menu stays visible.</li>
                <li>Masked the password field in the CBFTP Site editor.</li>
                <li>Changed the CBFTP Site editor so selecting an existing site loads it immediately.</li>
                <li>Changed the FXP Client so CBFTP server/site dropdowns load immediately and restored right-click actions.</li>
                <li>Restored FXP Client column sorting for Name, Size and Modified.</li>
                <li>Fixed first Start after app launch so site configs are reloaded before deciding no sites are ready.</li>
                <li>Fixed site config loading used by Start so synced/legacy site files are not rejected after the main scan loaded them.</li>
                <li>Fixed Chat user list refresh without reintroducing the unstable chat tab/render changes.</li>
            </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-version">v2.0.2 WebUI</div>
            <div class="timeline-date">August 2026</div>
            <ul>
                <li>Added Settings controls for WebUI port, bind address, data folder, remote access notes and reverse proxy/SSL guidance.</li>
                <li>Added Windows migration for old WinForms <code>ENC:</code> passwords and Blowfish keys to v2 <code>ENC2:</code> secrets.</li>
                <li>Added a RaceTrade application icon for the Windows executable and browser favicon.</li>
                <li>Updated Help with WebUI startup, data folder, remote access, Linux/headless and migration guidance.</li>
            </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-version">v2.0.1 WebUI</div>
            <div class="timeline-date">August 2026</div>
            <ul>
                <li>Restored CBFTP site import from the WebUI.</li>
                <li>Restored the CBFTP Site editor with basic settings, limits, transfer flags, affils, sections and skiplist.</li>
                <li>Added Edit CBFTP Site from the Sites list and the Site Editor CBFTP Site tab.</li>
                <li>Restored the Get Site Rules modal from the site editor.</li>
                <li>Restored the dual-pane FXP Client in the WebUI.</li>
                <li>Restored the Affil Spread &amp; Pre Manager flow and PreDB release import in the WebUI.</li>
                <li>Reworked the Site Editor Sections tab into a clearer master-detail workflow.</li>
                <li>Restored Section Rules and CBFTP Mapping Rules in the WebUI Site Editor.</li>
                <li>Added one-click Racing/Off toggles for IRC sections in the section list.</li>
                <li>Restored the full IMDB and TVMaze section filter controls with preset genre, network and show type lists.</li>
                <li>Restored request auto-fill helper labels and placeholder guidance in the Site Editor Requests tab.</li>
                <li>Restored regex test inputs, test buttons and examples for PreBots and Site Editor announce parsing.</li>
                <li>Improved dark theme spacing, sidebar buttons, table forms, status labels and document pages.</li>
            </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-version">v2.0.0 WebUI</div>
            <div class="timeline-date">August 2026</div>
            <ul>
                <li>Added the new local WebUI that runs together with the racing engine in one app.</li>
                <li>Split the racing engine into <code>RaceTrade.Engine</code> and the browser UI into <code>RaceTrade.Web</code>.</li>
                <li>Added Dashboard, Sites, CBFTP servers, PreBots, Pre, FXP Client, Test release, Chat, Logs, Settings, Help and Changelog pages.</li>
                <li>Added self-contained builds for Windows and Linux.</li>
            </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-version">v1.0.9b</div>
            <div class="timeline-date">July 2026</div>
            <ul>
                <li>Added movie lookup provider selection for Tiffara and TMDb.</li>
                <li>Fixed IMDB/TMDB/Tiffara lookup test behavior so cached data does not hide provider failures.</li>
                <li>Fixed global skiplist handling in release validation.</li>
                <li>Improved build-release scripting and release packaging behavior.</li>
                <li>Kept release packages to the required clean file set.</li>
            </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-version">v1.0.8b</div>
            <div class="timeline-date">July 2026</div>
            <ul>
                <li>Fixed TVMaze/IMDB settings persistence in the site editor.</li>
                <li>Fixed Add Affil text/background contrast.</li>
                <li>Added working global skiplist form and wildcard matching.</li>
                <li>Fixed Skiplist flow to check release-name strings, not files.</li>
                <li>Improved AntdUI dark theme styling, button spacing, drag movement and log window sizing.</li>
                <li>Moved changelog out of the help content in the WinForms build.</li>
            </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-version">v1.0.7b</div>
            <div class="timeline-date">January 2026</div>
            <ul>
                <li>Added the WinForms FXP browser.</li>
                <li>Added dual-pane CBFTP browsing and FXP transfer workflows.</li>
                <li>Added transfer logs and CBFTP browser operations such as delete, refresh and directory navigation.</li>
                <li>Improved CBFTP section/path handling used by the browser.</li>
            </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-version">Legacy WinForms builds</div>
            <div class="timeline-date">2024 - 2025</div>
            <ul>
                <li>Initial CBFTP integration, site configuration and IRC announce parsing.</li>
                <li>Rules engine, section mappings, affils, blacklist and request auto-fill features.</li>
                <li>IMDB and TVMaze filtering for movie and TV releases.</li>
                <li>Application, IRC, CBFTP and Race log separation.</li>
            </ul>
        </article>
    </section>
</div>
